Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我们这次的猎杀目标是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think it is that we're hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动物  植物也或是矿物质东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal, vegetable, mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道在你们眼里我是个老废物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you boys think I'm a bag of loose screws.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁救了老爸的次数我们数都数不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin saved dad's ass more times than we can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个了不起的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a great hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是  我很没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not. I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.36,0:00:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问我是不是失去了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me if I lost someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did -- my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.93,0:00:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Don.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我或许就会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just might be that hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个碰到本尼还结果了他的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that runs into Benny one day and ices him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这事是车到山前必有路  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we'll cross that bridge when we come to it, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:42.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你总是这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You keep saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.21,0:00:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(古德瑞的法式餐厅)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(路易斯安那州 卡伦科)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送安东尼回家  所以厨房交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent Anthony home, so the kitchen's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要锁好门  设好报警器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be sure to lock up the door and set the alarm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.83,0:01:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关掉空调  检查火炉  检查浅锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn off the a/c, check the burners, check the griddle...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.78,0:01:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有收拾冷盘食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And clear off the cold table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.36,0:01:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了  快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Go on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别忘了算清收支  登记入账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and don't forget to "Z" out the register...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.61,0:01:26.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,批处理好POS机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And batch out the credit-card machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我又不是第一次做了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darlin', it's not my first rodeo, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.74,0:01:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个伊丽莎白  真是个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a girl, that Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  真是好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-再续一杯  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Refill? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.36,0:01:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有计划追她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got designs?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于我来说  她更像是个小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's more like a little sister to me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:02:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你不介意我试一试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't mind if I take a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.01,0:02:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽可一试  首长\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all yours, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,续杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.65,0:02:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.30,0:03:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  你先跟紧  等我消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Great. Just, uh, just hang tight till you hear from me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  听着  我让你跟紧就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, listen to me. I said hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让我先吃完汉堡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I at least finish my burger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人被吸血鬼杀死了  迪恩  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a vamp kill, Dean -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.85,0:04:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在路易斯安那州的卡伦科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carencro, Louisiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没都吃过蔬菜海鲜辣炖汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while since I've had some étouffée.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁提供的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the source?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁·奎恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin Creaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  刚刚有那么一瞬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry -- for a minute there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你说的是马丁·奎恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said Martin Creaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.69,0:04:24.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疯人院的疯狂马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy Martin from the loony bin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上个月他在格伦代尔泉医院获释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glendale Springs discharged him last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:27.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他不应该在保护病房拼玩具玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't he be assembling toys in a padded room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么又重操旧业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing back on the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我请他这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出来的时候给我打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he called me when he got out, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问我有没有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked if I had anything for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他重新开始猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}that might help him ease back into the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎康复了  基本康复了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed okay -- mostly -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我答应帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几周我都让他盯着本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had him tracking Benny for the past week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让"基本康复"的马丁去盯着本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put "mostly okay" Martin on Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"基本康复"的人猎魔都做些啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is "mostly okay" doing hunting at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:05:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是猎魔  迪恩  是跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hunting, Dean -- tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是观察报告  我交代得十分清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Observe and report only. I was crystal clear about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  迪恩  你不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Dean? You don't believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为本尼是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Benny's a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而一个称职的猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And any hunter worth his salt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该让吸血鬼在外自由游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't gonna let one just walk around freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我让马丁监视他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had Martin keep tabs on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在看来我的决定是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, it's looking like I made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁说这事是本尼做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Martin's saying Benny did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"好吧"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Okay"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果本尼在路易斯安那吸干人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Benny's in Louisiana draining folks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去查查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到路易斯安那)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(日租房)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说在找"火山爆发"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said "look for an eruption."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.61,0:06:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看维苏威火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Mount Vesuvius?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概一周前到的镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got into town about a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:24.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚之前一无所获  他没有行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up until last night, nothing. He's been clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干他自己的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just minding his own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在小酒馆里打工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working at the gumbo shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼在小酒馆里打工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny's working at the gumbo shack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  端盘子  倒咖啡  什么活都干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Slinging hash, pouring coffee -- the whole bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你面前他可能叫本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he may be Benny to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.51,0:06:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这里的人叫他罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks around here call him Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁  你确定自己没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, you sure you're running on a full charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上用一下休克疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}L-little s-shock therapy in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就活蹦乱跳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I-I'm good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说昨晚发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我像往常一样跟踪他回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I followed him home, just like every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拐上一条小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He turned up a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到一声尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟过去一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom -- there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒馆里罗伊打量的那个傻瓜  被吸干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old coot that Roy was eyeballing at the joint -- vamped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等...你到底有没有亲眼看到本尼杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait -- did you actually see Benny kill the guy or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没亲眼看到他动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, how can you be sure it was Benny
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能确定是本尼干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you didn't actually see him do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我看到本尼拐上那条小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-b-because I saw Benny turn up the path,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两秒钟之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then two seconds later,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就被一具喉咙被撕开的尸体绊倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trip over a body with its throat ripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有听说过奥卡姆剃刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, you ever hear of Occam's Razor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"简单的才是真相"  没那么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Keep it simple, stupid?" it's not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这中间有很多漏洞  马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of holes, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漏洞  我们现在要关注的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holes?! The only holes we should be looking at
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被害者脖子上的洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}are in the vic's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这像你认识的本尼会做的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sound like the Benny you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认得本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Benny you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.59,0:07:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么有一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I getting the distinct impression
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.24,0:07:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥哥在担保一个吸血鬼清白的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your brother is vouching for a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  不要吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, let's not argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人在吵  但是如果是本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's arguing, but if this is Benny --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只是假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's a big "If" --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他有交情  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got history with the guy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会问都不问就下手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not signing up for a witch hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠他的情不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe him more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全能的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in God's great creation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特家的人怎么会欠吸血鬼的情\N{\fnArial\fs30}could a Winchester possibly owe a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有听错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I hearing this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.31,0:07:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  查明真相之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, until we get the facts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先收起嗜血冲动  把这件事做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}we stow the bloodlust and we work this case right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们分开行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we work it separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他脑袋搬家才是把事做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing it right would be separating his head from his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要时间  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need some time, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  让尖牙鬼继续杀人  我看不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Let the fang take another life? I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真的要听他的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not actually considering this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:14.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几小时足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple hours, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真的是本尼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if it turns out to be Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果真是本尼  我自己处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it's Benny, and I'll deal with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几小时  迪恩  不能再多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple hours, Dean. No more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回头联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-hey. Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一走我们就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing this as soon as he pulls away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不行  马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得给他一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna give him a little bit of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.07,0:08:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的哥哥  你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's your brother. It's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还打算让他这样下去多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long are you gonna let him go on like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真相就摆在他面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's staring him right in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候要看清真相很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes it's not easy to see things for what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.87,0:09:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(德克萨斯州  克米特)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捡球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.69,0:09:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想好见他要说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought about what you're gonna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想了又想  想来想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've thought about it and thought about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有很多人告诉你正确的事情是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm sure you have a lot of people telling you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}what the right thing to do is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是你的丈夫  艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your husband, Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.97,0:09:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你和我在一起就是正确的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this is the right thing, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.91,0:09:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我会因为说这句话而下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe I'm going to hell for saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不想就此放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not ready to give this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你介意我花几天时间清醒一下头脑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it bother you if I just took a few days to clear my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多长时间都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, take whatever time you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.93,0:10:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  我已经想好要什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I already know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜猜  秋葵汤饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess...gumbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我看到那些派之前是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was gonna be the gumbo till I saw pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特色山核桃派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the special's pecan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.17,0:11:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的山核桃派卖完了  我命该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of pecan. Story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  也许你可以补偿给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that's all right. Maybe you can make it up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:10.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我事实上是来找一位老朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually looking for an old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说他就在这附近  罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard he's kicking around these parts. His name's Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊在这里上夜班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Roy works the night shift here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们说的是同一个罗伊的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if we're talking about the same Roy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他住在一个破旧的帐篷里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, he, uh, putts around in a beat-up camper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来就像是恶魔禁地一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing looks like a rolling deathtrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.15,0:11:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I thought I was the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘲笑他住的那一堆垃圾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who gave him trouble over that piece of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你知不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to know
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这几天把帐篷搭在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he's parking that thing these days, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本来就把帐篷搭在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he, uh, was parking it out back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他刚打电话告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just called to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说他要从公路去磨坊河几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gone up the road to Mill Creek for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说为什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, did he say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是去钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... fishing, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.83,0:11:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真的该休息一段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really deserves a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他近两周天天上双倍的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been working doubles for the last two weeks straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, listen, I, uh, I tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他在我找到他之前过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he pops up before I can find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮个忙让他给我打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}you do me a favor and just have him give me a buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:11:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以直接打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could just drop a dime yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, you are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我改天来吃派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a rain check on that pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.15,0:12:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(古德瑞的法式餐厅)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.65,0:12:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请在嘟一声后留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a message at the beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  我在卡伦科找到了一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny. I got a body here in Carencro
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脖子上被咬了两个洞的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}with two holes in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又刚得知你去钓鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just found out you went fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:39.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要我告诉你这像发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I need to tell you what this looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(一条新留言)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我干的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.70,0:13:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的是哪个"我"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, which "me" are we talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  还是罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny...or Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想融入这一带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,融入\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blend in"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚把谁埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you plant, Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二号遇害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victim number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想问我为什么不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're concerned about the missed calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原因是我不想把你牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to get you involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先放一放那事  谈一谈怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to safety that thing, talk a little bit or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是独居的吸血鬼干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天晚上来到餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came into the cafe a couple nights ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.22,0:14:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名叫德斯蒙德的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Youngster goes by the name of Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想起了过去的好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, uh, he remembers me from the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去的好时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good old days?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:43.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很难相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不是一直都像现在这么可爱招人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I haven't always been this cute and cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.82,0:14:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来和我叙叙旧  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's chasing a memory, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在组建新的巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's crewing up a new nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望我能带给他一点人气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hoping I can give him some cred.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拒绝了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到这一切都还好  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So far, so good. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:06.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接说那血案是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to the part about the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想让我回心转意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't want to take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想刺激我  丢下死尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to roust me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我变回来的自己  加入他\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving dead bodies in my wake till I sign up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天两具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two bodies in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人能把我赶出故乡  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No amateur is gonna kick me out of my hometown, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"故乡"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hometown"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.77,0:15:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grew up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.48,0:15:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土生土长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born and bred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚死后  你重出江湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Andrea gone and you hunting again,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎是时候到我回归故里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seemed like the right time for a homecoming,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有你们兄弟才能让我服服帖帖\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two being the only ones who keep all my ducks in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在一家餐厅重操旧业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went back to my old job at the cafe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至找到一个我该负责的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even found someone I hold myself accountable to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我血肉相连的人  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best kind of someone, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的曾孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}My great-granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.15,0:16:10.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.40,0:16:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hold it, now. You didn't --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.01,0:16:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.27,0:16:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  对她而言  我不过是一个过客\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, as far as she's concerned, I was just another drifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢如此行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里想过得舒服很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been tough walking the line here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些年在炼狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all those years in purgatory
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过惯了不缺食物的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not having to deal with the hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Elizabeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.47,0:16:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让我变得诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}She keeps me honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于觉得是时候处理这件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally feel like I got a handle on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.81,0:16:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handle on things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  你手上有两具死尸  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, you've got two stiffs on your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:49.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个猎人对你穷追不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two hunters on your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  是在餐厅找到我的笨蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. The half-wit who found me at the cafe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒想陪他玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take my chances with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个笨蛋是我弟弟派来的  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That half-wit was sent by my brother, and trust me --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟绝对不是你想去招惹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother's not someone you want to mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间陪他们玩  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time to worry about them, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前以为德斯蒙德不会惹祸上身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think Desmond had an ounce of steel in his spine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was wrong about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在我要去做两天前就该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I'm gonna do what I should have done two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.65,0:17:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他送到他该在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is put him back where he belongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:19.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道解决此事只有一个办法  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's only one way to do that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是让你袖手旁观\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is for you to sit on the sideline
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说服萨姆和马丁跟踪德斯蒙德\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I convince Sam and Martin to go after Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see you out there, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不问青红皂白   \N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't care if you're gonna be 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:29.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会把你格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}collecting for the march of dimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没说话  他们就让你身首异处  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They are gonna slice first and ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.97,0:17:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:38.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他们会接手此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think they'll go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟踪那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I follow your boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.03,0:17:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来到一条恐怖的小径\N{\fnArial\fs30}...down a freaking path
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被惨遭吸血鬼杀害的尸体绊倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and trip over fresh vamp kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你还亲眼所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you practically catch him in the act
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在掩埋另外一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}of burying a second body
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.76,0:18:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要偏袒他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're still taking his side?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼会找郊区落单的人下手  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires pick people off from the outskirts of town, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会舍近求远在他曾孙女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the cafe that they work in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上班的餐厅下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}with their great-grandkids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  杀害人类不是他的行事风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, killing any human -- it's not his style.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不是他的行事风格"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not his style"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.29,0:18:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不是他的行事风格"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not his style"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.89,0:18:23.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们来此调查一具死尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Dean, we came here on a dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我们给你点时间  \N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for some time, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又发现一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now there's another dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能相信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we just going on trust here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为死在我们手上的吸血鬼为数不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we've killed for a lot less,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你知道他们对我们恨之入骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know how these things turn out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do -- too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:44.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我经历的每一段关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, every relationship I have ever had
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在某种程度上都很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}has gone to crap at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我可以说唯独有本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the one thing I can say about Benny --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从没让我失望过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.12,0:18:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good on you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.23,0:18:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过这么多年你一定为终于找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must feel great finally finding someone you can trust
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:18:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以信任的人而高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}after all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说本尼是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is that Benny is innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感情用事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too close to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你执意要做  我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you do, I'm gonna tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能捡回性命算便宜你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be lucky to get out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你和他一起去  你也死期不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you -- you go with him, you're a dead man -- period.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:31.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想那些无辜的生命  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are innocent lives we're talking about, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.31,0:19:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会为本尼的一片之词冒险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're willing to risk that on Benny's word alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What...was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩做了选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean made his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去忙正经事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go do our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你爸刚才没听到那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad your dad wasn't around to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会想把你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd have a mind 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从柴棚里揪出来  告诉你们那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take you both out the woodshed and show you what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想亲自这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half inclined to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能带你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能轻松地把你丢出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can bring you out just as easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你想做的唯一一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the only thing you're gonna be inclined to do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是闭好嘴跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}is shut up and follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.98,0:20:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  哥哥选择相信吸血鬼而不是弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying-- brother chooses a vampire over a brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我会是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how I'd feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.43,0:20:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是萨姆  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Sam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.91,0:20:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来这打架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了发生在你身上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about what happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.47,0:20:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.11,0:21:05.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们陷入难题了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got ourselves a situation here now, though, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.54,0:21:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是我不能为此责怪你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, I can't blame either of you for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.26,0:21:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前我觉得自己死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, there were days there I thought I was a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.29,0:21:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是当我回来的时候  我回来却面对这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I do come back and what I come back to is this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时会想这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, it ain't no great mystery if part of me is thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这样到底是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's wrong with this picture?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, let me finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道她还爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know part of her loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of her loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只有艾米利亚自己知道对她来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the only one that knows what's best for Amelia
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好的选择是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.08,0:21:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以当一切说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when all of this is said and done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.29,0:21:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也做出决定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she's made her decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尊重她的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll respect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:06.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的爱她  你也会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you truly love her, you'll do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再给他一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could use another.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不信  他们去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't go for it. They're on their way to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd get scarce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.23,0:22:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无意冒犯  迪恩  可你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, Dean, but your little brother
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.89,0:23:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可真是吓不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't exactly put chills up my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.61,0:23:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别低估我弟弟  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not underestimate my little brother, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有机会的话  他完全可以杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can and will kill you given the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.30,0:23:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.19,0:23:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找德斯蒙德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go find Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.85,0:23:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.34,0:23:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I just told you --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好低调一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}best thing you can do is lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这回不行  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't gonna work this time, bub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带上我  否则我不告诉你他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take me with, or I don't tell you where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.37,0:23:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说除非我加入他的小巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he's not gonna stop the killing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则他不会停止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I join his little nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:36.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死两个人已经够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two bodies is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他说我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.12,0:23:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你加不加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in or are you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.57,0:23:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西把他吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something spooked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.20,0:24:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米利亚·理查森  萨姆  我需要你的帮助  快来)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.57,0:24:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.73,0:24:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是温彻斯特家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.06,0:24:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.07,0:25:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.58,0:25:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先按兵不动  等你们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hang back while you guys 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝喝酒确认是否可以相互信任吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do some trust falls and binge-drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:08.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  要不是我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, if I didn't know you better,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.56,0:25:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说你还真是瞧不起吸血鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you have an extremely low opinion of us vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫有益的怀疑精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it healthy skepticism.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.91,0:26:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼可没告诉我他带了朋友过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny never told me he was bringing a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.95,0:26:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会废话太多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna talk a lot, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been dealing with crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都跟神经病打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}...all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.61,0:26:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.74,0:26:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真是慢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差一点啊  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost a step, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.83,0:26:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能再吃那些垃圾食品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to lay off the junk food.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.84,0:27:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.65,0:27:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.81,0:27:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里的生活结束了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life here is over, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.96,0:27:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.03,0:27:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦消息走漏出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once word gets out...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.61,0:27:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些猎人就会追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the machete swingers that'll come for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是对付不完的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.21,0:27:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if you could...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.23,0:27:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.11,0:27:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这样的人  没法定居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like us, we don't get a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.15,0:27:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.57,0:27:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.82,0:28:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.49,0:28:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼  你必须躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny, you got to go deep underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.61,0:28:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲到没人知道你身份的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where nobody knows who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.84,0:28:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有最后一件事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one last thing I got to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.57,0:28:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(呼叫艾米利亚·理查德森)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.73,0:28:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您拨打的电话暂时无法接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person you are trying to reach is unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.86,0:28:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.81,0:28:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.22,0:28:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.23,0:28:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.22,0:28:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唐在酒吧找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don found you at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.39,0:28:59.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.12,0:28:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他威胁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He threatened you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚  他没有威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia, no. He didn't threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我只是想做正确的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just trying to do the right thing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.13,0:29:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"正确的事"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The right thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.67,0:29:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早我们俩在一起就是正确的事情  忘了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning, you and I were the right thing, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很明白  你和唐需要一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you and Don deserve a chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.23,0:29:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心里也清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...I think you know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.73,0:29:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他一次机会吧  你不是也给了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give him a chance -- like you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.25,0:29:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.74,0:29:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾米利亚  你拯救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amelia, you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.92,0:29:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(克米特26号公路)
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.68,0:29:57.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该走了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.27,0:30:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你没有放弃我  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for not giving up on me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.02,0:30:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别给我这样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me a reason to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.53,0:30:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.83,0:30:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打电话就是要告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just calling to let you know
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题已经解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the situation is resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.86,0:30:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼没说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny was not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.70,0:30:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个吸血鬼  我们一起解决了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was another vamp, and we ganked him -- together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That's good, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, shut up and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.76,0:30:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼远走高飞了  再也不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny's long gone, and he won't be coming back ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.14,0:31:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你好  别再找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for your own sake, do not follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用不着担心我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.58,0:31:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也远走高飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm long gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.65,0:31:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, Martin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.07,0:31:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.10,0:31:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换个行当吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a new line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(伊丽莎白来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.79,0:31:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  莉兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.82,0:31:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代班情况怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your shift going?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.53,0:31:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  她代替你干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say she's covering for you just fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.13,0:31:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们这些常客  还是想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But us regulars -- we miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.23,0:31:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.67,0:31:52.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know who this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.25,0:31:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么拿到她手机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell you get her phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:31:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢吃樱桃酱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You enjoy the cherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.64,0:31:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.34,0:32:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没吃完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.06,0:32:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联系上你的朋友了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you, uh, reach your friend okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.13,0:32:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.38,0:32:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信  我居然把手机掉在巴士上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I left my cell on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.21,0:32:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老婆常说我的脑袋要是没拧紧  肯定弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wife says I'd lose my own head if it wasn't screwed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.14,0:32:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要再说一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just be another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.67,0:32:13.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.78,0:32:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.09,0:32:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是个好女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.76,0:32:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对陌生人很友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes kindly to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.87,0:32:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你立刻离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave her alone -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.38,0:32:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你距离多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far away are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.05,0:32:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.16,0:32:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你四十五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got 45 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.01,0:32:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.11,0:32:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cellphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.37,0:33:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胳膊别乱动  邪恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay down your arms, you unholy thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.23,0:33:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me here, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.72,0:33:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如放了她  让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just let her go and walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.32,0:33:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没这打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.20,0:33:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞清楚  我可不是求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize I'm not asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.14,0:33:38.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realize that completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊  这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.91,0:33:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  莉兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.19,0:33:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道不对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.41,0:33:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.05,0:33:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你我之前毫无过节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no beef with you. You got no beef with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.00,0:33:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你这种人可有仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got plenty of beef with your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.18,0:33:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.36,0:34:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may be so,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.15,0:34:03.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是和这里发生的事无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not for anything that happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.58,0:34:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没杀那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not kill those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.26,0:34:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.74,0:34:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和迪恩在炼狱有过交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dean had a little purgatory reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.46,0:34:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touching.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.42,0:34:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.75,0:34:15.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就告诉我到底出了什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just tell me what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.25,0:34:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.97,0:34:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求你  别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you -- do not do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.06,0:34:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个恶棍已经痛改前非了  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad guy is gone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.49,0:34:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.47,0:34:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.38,0:34:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.38,0:34:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本尼是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.92,0:34:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"本尼是谁"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who's Benny"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.75,0:34:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就弄个真相大白吧  如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.42,0:34:42.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.96,0:34:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.67,0:34:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞳孔扩大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dilated pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.57,0:34:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头发直竖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hair standing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饥饿的征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signs of hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.70,0:35:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.91,0:35:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会吃掉自己的亲骨肉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't feed off his own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.28,0:35:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"亲骨肉"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Flesh and blood"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她啊  本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her, Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.15,0:35:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她你就是她失散多年的爷爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her how you're her long-lost grandpappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.78,0:35:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她你欠下了多少条人命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her about all the dead you left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.51,0:35:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她你是个什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her about the monster that you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.29,0:35:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.31,0:35:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够清楚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.43,0:35:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要你的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your head on a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.71,0:36:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗伊  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roy, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.56,0:36:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.31,0:36:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望他们给你在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hope they're saving a special place for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.46,0:36:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留了个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherever it is you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.10,0:36:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.54,0:37:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得今晚还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel all right tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.99,0:37:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.05,0:37:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.80,0:37:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.64,0:37:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.48,0:38:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说要是我看到他  就打给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you told me to call you if I saw...him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.92,0:38:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是  看到罗伊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? Roy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.27,0:38:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.58,0:38:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在就在你旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he there right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.76,0:38:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白  出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elizabeth, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.22,0:38:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.22,0:39:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(艾米利亚·理查森  萨姆  我需要你的帮助  快来)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.65,0:40:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.29,0:40:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"萨姆  我需要你的帮助  快来"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sam, I need your help. Come quick."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.48,0:40:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.72,0:40:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用个火炉就换来了艾米利亚的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swapping Amelia's phone out with a burner,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.39,0:40:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发了求救短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending a distress signal...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.96,0:40:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找准了我的死穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.52,0:40:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.63,0:40:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一阵了  以备我不时之需\N{\fnArial\fs30}While back, in case I needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.47,0:40:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我的决定是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.38,0:40:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我看见她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.35,0:40:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她挺好的  不过这你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's doing just fine. But, 'course, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.69,0:40:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.51,0:40:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道这是唯一让你休息的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did know it was the only way to get you to lay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.15,0:40:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.80,0:40:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.27,0:40:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.31,0:41:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人伤亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any casualties?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.65,0:41:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丁死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.44,0:41:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是本尼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it Benny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.94,0:41:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自找的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had it coming, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.68,0:41:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你发生什么事了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.44,0:41:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是怎么回事  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I know what happened, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.69,0:41:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想不想听我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you want to listen to me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.49,0:41:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.07,0:41:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that was you.
